<title>GREECE: TABLE - GREEK/BUND GAP NARROWS TO 395BPS, 295 VS BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE - GREEK/BUND GAP NARROWS TO 395BPS, 295 VS BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds narrowed to 395 basis points on Friday from Thursday's 398.</p>
<p>The Greek/BTP gap shrank to 295 basis points from 300 on Thursday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.65%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.00%   04JUL07    5.70%	395	398 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.50%   25APR07    5.65%	401	403 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.70%	295	300 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.42%	323	330 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.40%	325	333 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.16%	249	250 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.36%	329	378 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 0915 GMT. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
